# sys-explosion (docs/research/story-scenes.md): Pastoria's Great Marsh bomb
# after Wake (CP9), from sys-gym-pastoria's end. Out of the gym (the city state is 4 after Barry's scene), onto
# the coord event at 610,810: the rival and Wake gather, the explosion's message waits on its sound, and
# scr_cmd_29f 1 runs (the BGM fades out, 16 callbacks, the camera shakes 4 units for 24 cycles losing an
# eighth each, 16 callbacks, the BGM fades back in) before the grunt appears; the scene ends with the city
# state 5 and the grunt moved east.
from sys-gym-pastoria.replay
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_PASTORIA_CITY"
+0 release down
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_PASTORIA_CITY_STATE 4
+0 press right
until position 598 828
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press up
until position 598 816
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press right
until position 610 816
+0 release right
until idle
+0 press up
until position 610 810
+0 release up
until message 300
advance text 6000
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_PASTORIA_CITY_STATE 5
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_PASTORIA_CITY_GRUNT_M_MOVED_EAST true
